  "decisions": [
    "Do not adopt the whole plate/color proposal yet. Frame and rules-paper color improve, but shared paper correction makes black and green name/type panels worse and artifact type paper slightly worse. Fit those source-local header panels independently using their existing masks.",
    "White frame identity is deliberately retained. Tile-center spread is a coarse color-texture diagnostic; it does not certify fine grain.",
    "Current trial includes existing rules-spacing/footer/basic-symbol work; it is separate from the earlier source trial that predated rules spacing.",
    "Names, costs, glyph colors/geometry, crowns, gold, colored artifacts, lands and walkers retain their own audit requirements. This is not set completion or default-transfer certification."
  ]
